# Coverage assets: keep only the deployed manifest + selected coverage files in Git.
# public/coverage/*
# !public/coverage/coverageManifest.json
# !public/coverage/53765.json
# !public/coverage/54048.json
# !public/coverage/54259.json

# Generated GEO prebuilt meshes/manifests are rebuilt from public/coverage.
public/coverage-prebuilt/

# GMAT is a 455 MB third-party install, not a dependency. Fixtures and scripts
# ARE committed; the installer, the disk image and the extracted tree are not.
# Patterns are root-anchored on purpose: a bare `gmat/` would also swallow
# docs/revisit/gmat, which holds the scripts that regenerate the fixtures.
*.dmg
/gmat/
/GMAT-R2026a*/
